@startuml
title Вариант 1. Основной сценарий: доставка через push
actor "Клиент" as U
participant "Сервис переводов" as P
participant "Notification API" as API
database "Redis" as R
queue "Kafka" as K
participant "Push Worker" as PW
participant "FCM / APNs" as F
participant "Timeout Checker" as TC
participant "Callback API" as CB

P -> API: POST /notifications (idempotency_key)
API -> R: SET NX idempotency_key
R --> API: OK (новый запрос)
API -> R: настройки пользователя
API -> K: tx.push (маршрут: push, sms, email)
API --> P: 202 Accepted
K -> PW: сообщение
PW -> F: отправить push (TTL 15 с)
F --> PW: принято
PW -> K: tx.push.wait
F -> U: push
U -> CB: ack (notification_id)
CB -> R: delivered:{id} = push
... 15 секунд ...
K -> TC: сообщение из tx.push.wait
TC -> R: delivered:{id}?
R --> TC: да
TC -> K: delivery.events (DELIVERED, push)
@enduml
